e he  was around the hulk all the time and  luckily we don't have that much longer  to wait for deadpool 3 because it looks  like production on that is going to be  starting pretty soon and since it  already has a release date according to  kevin feige that means the movie  shouldn't be more than two years away  and when it finally does come out i  personally really really hope that the  hulk is in deadpool 3 but let me know  what you think about all of this in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video and for a live update you can  follow me on instagram and twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof

